## Command

```shell
biome lint --only=nursery/useTailwindSortedClasses '<TEMP_DIR>/use_tailwind_sorted_classes_reads_stylesheet_outside_linted_paths/src'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "tailwind": { "stylesheet": "./styles/app.css" },
  "linter": { "rules": { "nursery": { "useTailwindSortedClasses": "error" } } }
}
```

## `src/App.jsx`

```jsx
export const a = <div className="bg-brand flex" />;

```

## `styles/app.css`

```css
@import "tailwindcss";
@import "./theme.css";
```

## `styles/theme.css`

```css
@theme { --color-brand: #00f; }
```

